<title>BELGIUM: EU to hold routine sugar meeting on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>EU to hold routine sugar meeting on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will hold a routine meeting on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The agenda is limited to the usual tenders, molasses duties and the fortnightly standing refunds,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
